sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as User / Client App
    participant Express as Express Gateway
    participant Storage as File Storage Provider
    participant Mongo as MongoDB
    participant Queue as Redis (BullMQ Queue)
    participant Worker as BullMQ Ingestion Worker
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI AI Service
    participant VectorDB as PostgreSQL (pgvector)

    %% Step 1: Upload & Validation
    Client->>Express: POST /api/v1/documents (multipart/form-data)
    Note over Express: 1. Validate JWT, file size (<=25MB), MIME type & PDF magic bytes (%PDF)
    
    %% Step 2: Storage
    Express->>Storage: 2. Store binary via generated storageKey (uploads/<userId>/<uuid>.pdf)
    Storage-->>Express: Storage confirmed
    
    %% Step 3: Metadata creation
    Express->>Mongo: 3. Create document metadata (status: "pending", fileHash, name)
    Mongo-->>Express: Document record created (_id)
    
    %% Step 4: Enqueue Job
    Express->>Queue: 4. Enqueue ingestion job (jobId: ingest_<docId>, docId, userId, storageKey)
    Express-->>Client: HTTP 202 Accepted { documentId, status: "pending" }
    
    %% Ingestion Execution
    Queue->>Worker: Consume job: process-document
    Worker->>Mongo: Update status to "processing"
    
    %% Step 5-8: AI Service processing
    Worker->>FastAPI: POST /internal/v1/rag/index (storageKey, docId, userId)
    Note over FastAPI: 5. Extract text while preserving physical page numbers
    Note over FastAPI: 6. Chunk text with configurable overlap (800 tokens, 150 overlap)
    Note over FastAPI: 7. Generate embeddings via replaceable provider adapter
    FastAPI->>VectorDB: 8. Persist chunk content, metadata & vectors (clean previous if retry)
    VectorDB-->>FastAPI: Commit confirmed
    FastAPI-->>Worker: HTTP 200 OK { totalPages, totalChunks, status: "ready" }
    
    %% Step 9: State Completion
    Worker->>Mongo: 9. Mark document status: "ready" with pageCount & chunkCount
    
    %% Step 10: Retries & Failure Handling
    opt On Error / Timeout / Rate Limit
        Worker->>Worker: 10. Exponential backoff retry (attempts <= 3)
        alt Retries Exhausted
            Worker->>VectorDB: Purge orphan chunks for docId
            Worker->>Mongo: Mark document status: "failed" (with errorReason)
        end
    end

